  "system": {
    "identifier": "inuzuka-dynamic-marking",
    "description": "<p>You command your Nin-Dog to leap into the air, and mark an all creatures in a 10-foot cube, centered on a point of your choice, within your Nin-Dogs movement speed range. Creatures marked in this way exude a faint but obvious stench that can be tracked by you or your Nin-Dog.</p>\n<p>For the duration, you &amp; your Nin-Dog are always aware of the direction of a marked creature and have blindsight only against marked creatures.</p>\n<p>For the duration, when you take the Search action, to find an affected creature, you have advantage on the check.</p>\n<p>Finally, attacks you and your Nin-Dog make have a +1 bonus to hit against marked creatures.</p>",
